uted Jews seek sanctuary at the mosque. Can Safiyyah find the courage to enter the treacherous catacombs under Paris and lead the Jews to safety? \n\n“Safiyyah's War has the soul of a classic & the urgency of a story for our times.” - Kiran Millwood Hargrave \n“All at once, Safiyyah's War broke my heart and filled me with immense hope.” - A F Steadman ","abridged":false,"accent":"UK English","audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/c2ac1595563a9857899a22457c1b13c0c963f359d4e88e8fb99f3d76def24d80/7Xkz33BqmudG42WqlwFJGeQCv087esTdZnbTUsUYYJI.mp3","copyright":"W. F. Howes Ltd, 2023","cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/U32aOk-zTtttq-KQzmeHbANE8dTmNVL2RGOT3ur8J14"},"languages":["en"],"status":{"name":"complete","updatedAt":"2024-05-27T11:04:18.167Z"},"accents":["UK English"],"authors":["Hiba Noor Khan"],"copyrights":["W. F. Howes Ltd, 2023"],"narrators":["Shala Nyx"]}}}